    <reapack name="mirelo.lua" type="script" desc="Mirelo — AI sound effects &amp; music for REAPER">
      <metadata>
        <description><![CDATA[Generate sound effects and music from a text prompt or the video on your timeline, and extend or inpaint audio clips — all inside REAPER, powered by Mirelo (https://mirelo.ai). Requires ReaImGui >= 0.9 (install via ReaPack) and curl >= 7.73 (in-box on modern OSes). SWS optional for in-panel preview.]]></description>
        <link rel="website" href="https://mirelo.ai">Mirelo</link>
      </metadata>
